    <!-- How to play -->
    <string name="rules_title">How to play</string>
    <string name="rules_body">• Roll the dice on your turn, then tap a glowing token to move it.\n• A token leaves the yard only on a 6.\n• A 6 gives you another roll. Three 6s in a row lose the turn.\n• Land on a single opponent token to send it back to its yard and roll again. Star squares are safe.\n• Two of your tokens on one square make a block. Your opponent cannot land on it or pass it.\n• You need the exact number to reach home. A token reaching home gives another roll.\n• You have 30 seconds per turn. Miss 3 turns in a row and you lose.\n• First to bring all four tokens home wins.</string>
